                <pb facs="0209" n="127" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg127"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 437.00/9.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic">June 16,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram of June 8 received. President Gómez requests me to ascertain as
                    soon as practicable whether or not President Taft will act as arbitrator.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jackson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
